# Why a pairing link pasted in Add Device > Nearby Sheprd cannot be used.

error-pairing-link-format = This is not a pairing link. On the other computer, open Remote control > Pair device and click Copy link.
error-pairing-link-no-relays = That computer listens on no relay, so it cannot be reached from another network. Turn on relays in its Settings > Remote control.
error-pairing-link-too-long = This is longer than any pairing link. Copy it again.
error-pairing-link-version = The link comes from a newer Sheprd. Update this one.
